#: scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d66484b18b6adc4cb2565c1503042c1364bfa2291131609710ea9b43f38bc3b4
#. default-sha256: c710cbc59298028b27b456b5ee23cb31975eec7e5b11780735b5ce1bd7f10c3e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t work on some nobleman’s estate,⟪k:1⟫but instead, I did physical labor—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"construction work.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I built roads and buildings, tore down hills and mountains."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não trabalhava na propriedade de algum nobre,⟪k:1⟫mas sim em trabalho braçal—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"trabalhava em obras.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu construía estradas e edifícios, derrubava colinas e montanhas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2540bb0200a964c1a7e4d6c3947c1f46d0a53af32e0c4355a4efb73cc6e1edf5
#. default-sha256: 81e24f46f0de1a7efdfe319df764eaa9f58791321e11632631bfc2084e4084a6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I doubt I need to tell you this, living conditions were miserable. ⟪k:1⟫Other "
"slaves withered away and died on a daily basis."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E embora eu duvide que precise lhe dizer isso, as condições de vida eram miseráveis. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Outros escravos definhavam e morriam diariamente."

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 104dcd85d258a55c1d0ea543a1497b1e2c5c768fd4382cd822a7172a2177d7d3
#. default-sha256: 23d022b8a85ffb2455f3763afe0290def1c88eb0b4c12e86294a305ce44bd463
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Working a noble’s estate would have been easier, without a doubt,⟪k:1⟫if only for the fact I "
"would have a specific master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Trabalhar na propriedade de um nobre teria sido mais fácil, sem dúvida,⟪k:1⟫se ao menos pelo "
"fato de eu ter um mestre específico."

#: scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df0450a5dbb19c61f2fd5bdfb2369f157193c05c8a1749ecd88c8c2f4d776f14
#. default-sha256: d10bb099d4734d265972202d11826390c466924be94b8dad865508b94e539a67
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t remember anything about my life before becoming a slave.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I have are "
"those few images, from which I can guess I was part of a caravan,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não me lembro de nada da minha vida antes de me tornar escravo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tudo o que tenho "
"são essas poucas imagens, pelas quais posso imaginar que fiz parte de uma caravana,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 208404acc19becaa6d63ac4354bacdd643ae1a519c8c91aa333ff67944886876
#. default-sha256: 3122534bb047a45be89e3e3fcb5b7c2bb13263e22da9898ffb46c1a613e30462
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I next woke up, I had been stripped bare and was surrounded by men I didn’t recognize. "
"⟪k:1⟫The words they spoke were gibberish to my ears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando acordei novamente, eu estava completamente nú e cercado por homens que não "
"reconhecia. ⟪k:1⟫As palavras que eles falavam eram incompreensíveis para meus ouvidos."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
