msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 916a4c70959c975f3e043274e79ce770d7376c291563ad2e4025c1f0fcdd03d9
#. default-sha256: d404fb0cec85d4139f97afbfb7ac27fd7fba722e0a4326c9864c5a41a4d445c2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, I came to learn their language—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though I can only speak it; ⟪k:4⟫I "
"don’t know how to read or write."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com o tempo, aprendi a língua deles—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫embora eu só saiba falar; ⟪k:4⟫não sei "
"ler nem escrever."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b9182d8b82cd2771ec37643de4614d143e5ceb33cc3f51313a5785383dd5863
#. default-sha256: d94c7c42141516d26d7a0e38fe6b72384b43fd2f34652f9c95e4badc151f43f4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A darkness grew inside me with each repeated insult.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wanted to make them pay for "
"the daily abuse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma escuridão cresceu dentro de mim a cada insulto repetido.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu queria fazê-los "
"pagar pelo abuso diário."

#: scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66d9e0847d83eec8b8cdb03e44cc83883f7962209ea6014ac5cd029aa7453327
#. default-sha256: 26045dde693fa2475583ee3ed488c7d68cbac73515e081bce276a786298fae82
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And who wouldn’t? The desire to exact vengeance when you’ve been mistreated is only natural. "
"It’s perfectly reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E quem não gostaria? O desejo de vingança quando se é maltratado é natural. É perfeitamente "
"razoável."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8b151ce120c80ee9b6c7539f292e56469d345c6d9c597e6d40fcd7fda05c456
#. default-sha256: 3efa664662fc88e3423bf20ac2b9cdf175c75b136f03cf5b95a64219e37b2306
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They looked like me a year earlier: ⟪k:1⟫deprived of food and water and beaten into "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles pareciam comigo a um ano antes: ⟪k:1⟫privados de comida e água e espancados até a "
"submissão."

#: scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ef514655a6f14587a20952ee64a4cc5eb5eec93d3240c751f0ce183c6a69964
#. default-sha256: 98df37ad02507c6ab3ba658f62f919a84c6a9692d1b87d17fb0c1d8ea124c5e5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting beside me was a young girl, crying in silence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sentada ao meu lado estava uma jovem, chorando em silêncio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77799341f93474d13596eab9ca1d22cb746bec03a6d4da3d8676a44423e32bc4
#. default-sha256: 491d32d6af500d8e8dda10e6fd2e3b7e671a466b660c5e4381ec5cdb6e51523e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫perhaps because I had a similarly unusual appearance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What caught my attention, "
"though, was the way she was crying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫talvez porque eu tivesse uma aparência igualmente incomum.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O que me chamou a "
"atenção, porém, foi o jeito como ela chorava."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2dcedba88ed520d402ae5390f18a1e4c5c7cdf9a278957284be0cea59abfebb0
#. default-sha256: c1b5a1d25911bba4134c0d3377eae17f0692b81b580402358ef9d8555cab9cf7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, I still don’t understand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Até hoje, ainda não entendi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baad2fdc0f9abc874683373fb8dfa52a70ae7fd38a5144db0694fe83352480cd
#. default-sha256: dd880a0da422acfafb7c79d5a468168cac1873c591ba327abcc2fd2fa16399d5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so I took action, driven by that desire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E então eu tomei uma atitude, movido por esse desejo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
