#: scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39310b61a6293916732d4a9aea0f2c40035be95c1465710f1b34e5bd3dd0c3a5
