msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I have a wife... ⟪k:2⟫and children! Please!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E-⟪k:1⟫Eu tenho uma esposa... ⟪k:2⟫filhos! Por favor!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e39d811d6e5856d88b70214af8f5fa1c4784e0601ab9735e148f90328c377122
#. default-sha256: 8b5729ae0c9a66c7ae31e6621243c715454f458d7d1f300d0720b1c6de2917e2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even with the shackles still around my wrists, I had little trouble slaughtering the slave "
"traders and their guards."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mesmo com as algemas ainda em volta dos meus pulsos, tive pouca dificuldade em massacrar os "
"traficantes de escravos e seus guardas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDB36FD1_459A_41A4_BDCD_13E71889DFF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 336c50709ed716eb1a2a809577172d704f5acb14077b2be41115b294f3a484b0
